'''Hitomi Saionji''' (西園寺 瞳 ''Saionji Hitomi'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hitomi Saionji
|image = E 143.png
|appearance = [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 460円 - 1,817円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health but pathetic range and damage. Hitomi Saionji is able to serve as an enemy version of [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] so using anything that is hard hitting like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]].

In [[Super Clash!! Kishidan!!]] Hitomi Saionji is at his highest magnification being at 1,600%, now making a threat to be with dealing 6,400 damage and a high health of 720,000!

==Strategy==
He won't be a threat since he has low attack power, range, and health. Even at [[Super Clash!! Kishidan!!]], his extremely low range makes it so he will only hit your meatshields and basically nothing else. He doesn't have enough damage to effectively kill meatshields in time with his long attack animation, so you can just spam all the ranged attackers or low-ranged attackers all you want until he is defeated.

